<title>USA: Wall Street shares seen firmer at opening.</title>
<headline>Wall Street shares seen firmer at opening.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street stocks are expected to open firmer on Thursday, buoyed by positive momentum from the stock market's rally on Wednesday and led by the persistently strong technology sector, analysts said.</p>
<p>&quot;We should see follow-through from yesterday, which was a very good session,&quot; Hildegard Zagorski, an analyst at Prudential Securities said.</p>
